-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This software is provided under a Community Free License with the following terms:
- Any individual, company, or organization is granted a free, perpetual, and legal
  license to deploy, run, and use all core features of SecureMail on their own
  servers or private cloud environments, provided that the total number of active
  mailboxes does not exceed five (<= 5 Users).
- This includes internal business operations and commercial usage within the 5-user limit.
- The Community Free License does not include direct vendor SLA technical support,
  custom development, or dedicated engineering assistance.

1.2 Enterprise Commercial License (More than 5 Users / Custom SLA)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
If your enterprise or organization requires:
- More than five active mailboxes (> 5 Users);
- Guaranteed 24x7 / 8x5 vendor SLA technical support and maintenance;
- Custom feature development, bespoke integration, or custom security plugins;
- Dedicated enterprise-signed RSA-4096 license certificates and High Availability (HA) support;

Please contact the SecureMail commercial team to obtain an Enterprise Commercial License:
- Contact Email: mozhenbear@zodic.dev
- Commercial Inquiries: mozhenbear@zodic.dev

